@props/gmsol-wasm

pkg-node/ and pkg-web/ are compiled from GMTrade's gmx-solana repository, release v0.10.0
(https://github.com/gmsol-labs/gmx-solana, tag v0.10.0, commit 7ce035b41a266cb5ddb0192e5d29deb0c7e67a72),
crates gmsol-sdk, gmsol-model, gmsol-programs and gmsol-utils, with one modification:
patches/liquidation-price.patch, which replaces the liquidation-price calculation in
crates/sdk/src/position/mod.rs with the version on the repository's main branch (unreleased at the
time of the build, commit 5841d106): it uses min_collateral_factor_for_liquidation, the factor the
store program's liquidation check uses, instead of min_collateral_factor.

